<< /A 36 0 R /Alt (Flowchart outlining the study identification and screening process. Left panel depicts studies identified via databases: 62 records initially, 16 removed as duplicates, 32 excluded after abstract reading, leaving 14 for full reading. Seven were excluded upon full reading, resulting in eight included studies. Right panel shows identification via other methods: one hand-searched reference, assessed and included. Total included studies from both methods is nine.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 26 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (Timeline and table schematic. \(A\) A timeline from July to September 2024, illustrating stages of treatment including external radiotherapy \(RT\), photobiomodulation therapy \(PBMT\), and brachytherapy, alongside ARD and RRR symptoms. \(B\) A dosimetry table for various wavelengths \(blue, amber, red, near-infrared\) detailing parameters like wavelength, power, session count, and device specifications per emitter type, including manufacturer and model information.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Three-panel image showing medical treatment areas. Panel A: 3D-rendered model with blue-shaded treatment regions on the pelvis; arrows marked 1 and 2. Panel B: CT scan with color overlays indicating radiation levels on the pelvic area; arrows marked 3, 4, and 5. Panel C: Photograph showing skin changes in a similar anatomical area; arrows marked 6, 7, 8, and 9.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 32 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
